{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちわかつき(｀_´)ゞ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の記事でまさかの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北海道の記事の写メを消し忘れてプレゼントやファンレターのお礼にまったく関係のない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"野菜カレーを載せたどうも、若月です。しかも コメントを見るまで気づいていなかったという失態orz。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに、過去ログを見ていただくとわかりますが…以前も自撮りを載せたつもりがなぜか東京タワーが載っていらっしゃいました。もう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/08/dimg0177.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月ったらおちゃめさんっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/08/dimg0094.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"……………すみませんでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/08/a4ca5f.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうして こうなるんでしょう。それは若月が力んでるから"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/08/dimg0029.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分どんまい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/08/dimg0202.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大丈夫だよ！…………うん。はぁ…。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"という訳で、今回の記事はまた不思議な前置きから始まりましたが(  ；∀；)backボタンを押さないでね・゜・(つД｀)・゜・笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さぁ、今回はコメント内で質問をしてくれる方がいらっしゃるので多い質問等々に返したいと思います!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ１:結局あの足が痒いのはどうなったの？(過去記事参照)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"┗靴下を２、３回引っ張りました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ２:サンタには何を頼む？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"┗サンタさん…欲はいいません。ファンのみなさんと直接交流できるイベントを沢山ください。若月はだいぶサンタに無理なお願いをした(笑)むしろスタッフさんに頼めよってね(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ３:『ワカツキ』と『みゅうみゅう』どっちが多かった？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"┗呼びやすいのは『ワカツキ』が多かったです！でも、『みゅうみゅう』の方が可愛いとの意見を多数いただきました(σ*´∀｀)叫んで下さるときはワカツキで(笑)他はお任せします(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ４:若月はインドア？アウトドア？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"┗激しくアウトドアです(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その他の質問においては、過去記事で答えてたりするので見てね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/08/dimg0218.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はこれくらいで(σ*´∀｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では最後に、以前載せたカツオくんの写メが膨れっ面で不細工すぎるといわれたのでちゃんとしたものを載せます(´・ω・｀)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/08/dimg0181.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←ぇ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},